WISA STUDIO
===========

WISA STUDIO is a **display-layer rebrand of oh-my-pi's desktop GUI**. The
application code is the oh-my-pi GUI; WISA changes the product name, the
interface language (Vietnamese), the seeded model gateway, and the packaging
metadata. The agent that does the work is upstream's.

